<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="description" content="Food for My Love, authentic Nicaraguan recipes created by John Stout for his husband, Yonathan Serrano.">
  <title>Food for My Love | Authentic Nicaraguan Recipes</title>
  <style>
    :root{--blue:#0b5fad;--dark:#073b70;--cream:#fffaf1;--white:#fff;--text:#17202a;--muted:#667085;--border:#e4ded5;--light:#eaf4ff}
    *{box-sizing:border-box}html{scroll-behavior:smooth}body{margin:0;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background:var(--cream);color:var(--text);line-height:1.6}
    .topbar{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:10;background:rgba(255,255,255,.96);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
    .nav{max-width:1100px;margin:auto;padding:16px 20px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
    .brand{color:var(--blue);font-size:21px;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none}.nav a{margin-left:18px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}
    .hero{min-height:680px;padding:80px 20px;display:grid;place-items:center;text-align:center;background:radial-gradient(circle at 15% 20%,rgba(11,95,173,.15),transparent 35%),radial-gradient(circle at 85% 15%,rgba(217,103,69,.12),transparent 32%),linear-gradient(135deg,#edf6ff,#fffaf1,#fff1e9)}
    .hero-content{max-width:820px}.label{display:inline-block;padding:9px 17px;background:#fff;color:var(--blue);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:999px;font-weight:800}
    h1{margin:24px 0 18px;color:var(--dark);font-size:clamp(48px,10vw,80px);line-height:1.04}.hero p{color:var(--muted);font-size:clamp(19px,3vw,24px)}
    .dedication{color:var(--dark)!important;font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:19px!important;font-style:italic}.buttons{margin-top:34px;display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap}
    .button{display:inline-block;padding:15px 24px;border-radius:13px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:800;border:1px solid transparent}.primary{background:var(--blue);color:#fff}.secondary{background:#fff;color:var(--blue);border-color:var(--border)}
    .section{max-width:1100px;margin:auto;padding:74px 20px}.section h2{margin:0 0 15px;font-size:clamp(34px,6vw,48px);line-height:1.15}.story{background:#fff}
    .story-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.4fr .8fr;gap:28px}.story-text{font-size:18px}.quote{padding:28px;background:var(--cream);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:18px;text-align:center}
    .quote blockquote{margin:0;color:var(--dark);font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:23px;font-style:italic}.feature-grid,.recipe-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:30px}
    .feature,.recipe{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:17px;overflow:hidden}.feature{padding:24px}.feature h3{color:var(--blue)}
    .recipes-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;align-items:end;flex-wrap:wrap}.recipes-head input{width:min(380px,100%);padding:14px 16px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;font-size:16px}
    .recipe-image{min-height:145px;display:grid;place-items:center;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--light),#fff1e9);font-size:56px}.recipe-body{padding:20px}
    .tag{display:inline-block;padding:5px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--light);color:var(--blue);font-size:13px;font-weight:800}.recipe h3{margin:12px 0 8px}
    .recipe p{color:var(--muted)}.recipe-link{display:block;padding:11px 14px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;text-align:center;text-decoration:none;font-weight:800}
    .book{background:var(--dark);color:#fff;text-align:center}.book p{color:rgba(255,255,255,.82)}footer{padding:30px 20px;background:#052b53;color:#fff;text-align:center}
    @media(max-width:850px){.story-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.feature-grid,.recipe-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}}
    @media(max-width:650px){.nav div{display:none}.buttons{flex-direction:column}.button{width:100%}.feature-grid,.recipe-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.section{padding:60px 18px}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<header class="topbar"><nav class="nav"><a class="brand" href="#home">Food for My Love</a><div><a href="#story">Our Story</a><a href="#recipes">Recipes</a><a href="#book">The Book</a></div></nav></header>
<main>
<section class="hero" id="home"><div class="hero-content"><span class="label">Authentic Nicaraguan Recipes</span><h1>Food for My Love</h1><p>A collection of Nicaraguan recipes created with love by John Stout for his husband, Yonathan Serrano.</p><p class="dedication">“For Yonathan, with all my love.”<br>— John</p><div class="buttons"><a class="button primary" href="#recipes">Explore Recipes</a><a class="button secondary" href="Food for my love.pdf" target="_blank">Read the Complete Book</a></div></div></section>

<section class="story" id="story">
  <div class="section">
    <div class="story-grid">
      <div>
        <h2>The Story Behind the Book</h2>

        <div class="story-text">
          <p>
            Food for My Love began as a gift of love from John Stout
            to his husband, Yonathan Serrano.
          </p>

          <p>
            John created this book to celebrate Yonathan’s Nicaraguan roots
            and bring together the flavors, memories, and traditions of
            Nicaraguan cuisine in one special place.
          </p>

          <p>
            More than a collection of recipes, this book represents love,
            family, cultural heritage, and a connection to home.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="quote">
        <div style="font-size:38px">♥</div>

        <blockquote>
          “May these recipes always bring you closer to home.”
        </blockquote>

        <p>From John to Yonathan</p>
      </aside>
    </div>

    <div class="feature-grid">
      <article class="feature">
        <div>📖</div>
        <h3>82 Recipes</h3>
        <p>A wide collection of traditional Nicaraguan dishes.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="feature">
        <div>🇳🇮</div>
        <h3>Nicaraguan Heritage</h3>
        <p>Recipes that preserve culture, memories, and family traditions.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="feature">
        <div>♥</div>
        <h3>Created with Love</h3>
        <p>A personal gift created by John for Yonathan.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="recipes">
  <div class="recipes-head">
    <div>
      <h2>Featured Recipes</h2>
      <p>Search the recipes currently featured on the site.</p>
    </div>

    <input
      id="recipeSearch"
      type="search"
      placeholder="Search recipes..."
      aria-label="Search recipes"
    >
  </div>

  <div class="recipe-grid" id="recipeGrid">

    <article class="recipe" data-name="Arroz Ancha">
      <div class="recipe-image">🍚</div>

      <div class="recipe-body">
        <span class="tag">Rice</span>

        <h3>Arroz Ancha</h3>

        <p>
          A rich rice dish with coconut milk, vegetables, and spices.
        </p>

        <a
          class="recipe-link"
          href="Food for my love.pdf#page=1"
          target="_blank"
        >
          View Recipe
        </a>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="recipe" data-name="Arroz Aguado">
      <div class="recipe-image">🍲</div>

      <div class="recipe-body">
        <span class="tag">Rice</span>

        <h3>Arroz Aguado</h3>

        <p>
          A comforting rice dish with broth, vegetables, and meat.
        </p>

        <a
          class="recipe-link"
          href="Food for my love.pdf#page=2"
          target="_blank"
        >
          View Recipe
        </a>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="recipe" data-name="Arroz con Pollo">
      <div class="recipe-image">🍗</div>

      <div class="recipe-body">
        <span class="tag">Rice</span>

        <h3>Arroz con Pollo</h3>

        <p>
          A family favorite made with chicken, rice, and vegetables.
        </p>

        <a
          class="recipe-link"
          href="Food for my love.pdf#page=6"
          target="_blank"
        >
          View Recipe
        </a>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="recipe" data-name="Baho en Managua">
      <div class="recipe-image">🍖</div>

      <div class="recipe-body">
        <span class="tag">Meat</span>

        <h3>Baho en Managua</h3>

        <p>
          Marinated meat, plantains, yuca, and vegetables slowly steamed.
        </p>

        <a
          class="recipe-link"
          href="Food for my love.pdf#page=7"
          target="_blank"
        >
          View Recipe
        </a>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="recipe" data-name="Berenjenas Rellenas">
      <div class="recipe-image">🍆</div>

      <div class="recipe-body">
        <span class="tag">Vegetables</span>

        <h3>Berenjenas Rellenas</h3>

        <p>
          Baked eggplants filled with seasoned meat and vegetables.
        </p>

        <a
          class="recipe-link"
          href="Food for my love.pdf#page=8"
          target="_blank"
        >
          View Recipe
        </a>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="recipe" data-name="Camarones al Ajillo">
      <div class="recipe-image">🦐</div>

      <div class="recipe-body">
        <span class="tag">Seafood</span>

        <h3>Camarones al Ajillo</h3>

        <p>
          Shrimp cooked in a fragrant garlic, butter, and citrus sauce.
        </p>

        <a
          class="recipe-link"
          href="Food for my love.pdf#page=10"
          target="_blank"
        >
          View Recipe
        </a>
      </div>
    </article>

  </div>
</section>

<section class="book" id="book">
  <div class="section">
    <h2>Read the Complete Cookbook</h2>

    <p>
      Open the original Food for My Love cookbook and explore all 82 recipes.
    </p>

    <a
      class="button secondary"
      href="Food for my love.pdf"
      target="_blank"
    >
      Open the Complete PDF
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
</main>

<footer>
  © 2026 John Stout and Yonathan Serrano · Food for My Love
</footer>

<script>
  const searchInput = document.getElementById("recipeSearch");
  const cards = document.querySelectorAll(".recipe");

  searchInput.addEventListener("input", function () {
    const text = searchInput.value.toLowerCase().trim();

    cards.forEach(function (card) {
      card.style.display =
        card.dataset.name.toLowerCase().includes(text)
          ? "block"
          : "none";
    });
  });
</script>
</body>
</html>